# Gasoline wholesale market collection via cron — stores the latest ICE Gasoil
# and Brent front-month futures and the ECB euro reference rate for
# `gasoline market backtest`. Nothing here changes the forecasts.
#
# One run is one OilPriceAPI request (OILPRICEAPI_KEY in the env file), so the
# hourly schedule below uses 24 of the free plan's 50 requests a day. The ECB
# rate needs no key; without OILPRICEAPI_KEY only the rate is stored.
#
# Cron starts with an empty environment: source the env file first (`set -a`
# exports the storage settings and the key). Everything below is ONE physical line.

7 * * * * set -a; . /etc/gasoline/gasoline.env; set +a; /usr/local/bin/gasoline market
